BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (Bristlecone Pets) Tj T* () Tj T* (Bristlecone Pets Executive Summary) Tj T* () Tj T* (Overview) Tj T* () Tj T* (Bristlecone Pets is a subscription service that leverages data driven personalization to) Tj T* (deliver durable dog toys and grooming supplies that are actually matched to each individual) Tj T* (dog. We are a student founded company, organized as an LLC, and we have a live website, a) Tj T* (working prototype app, and our first paying customers. This document is our executive summary) Tj T* (for the business plan competition.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The Problem) Tj T* () Tj T* (Dog owners spend alot of money on toys and grooming products and most of the time they are) Tj T* (guessing. A toy that is labeled indestructible or heavy duty is often destroyed within days by) Tj T* (a strong chewer, while a gentle dog may be sold a hard toy it never uses. The same is true for) Tj T* (grooming, where brushes and tools are marketed by breed but a dogs real shedding can vary a) Tj T* (great deal even within the same breed, season, and diet. The result is that owners waste money,) Tj T* (products end up in the trash, and the dogs themselves sometimes swallow pieces of broken toys) Tj T* (which is a safety concern. In our own informal conversations with about forty dog owners on and) Tj T* (around our university campus, most told us they had thrown away at least one toy in under a) Tj T* (week, and many said they simply gave up and buy the cheapest option because nothing seems to) Tj T* (last. There is no good way for an owner to know in advance what will hold up for their specific) Tj T* (dog. This is the gap we are addressing.) Tj T* () Tj T* (The Solution) Tj T* () Tj T* (Bristlecone Pets uses the information that is already sitting in every owners phone, which is) Tj T* (photos. Our customers upload photos of their dogs worn toys and, for grooming, photos of their) Tj T* (dogs coat and the hair collected after brushing. Our software then analyzes the wear patterns,) Tj T* (such as how deep the damage is, where on the toy it is concentrated, and how quickly the toy) Tj T* (broke down, and combines this with shedding indicators to build a profile of each dog. From) Tj T* (this profile we select toys and grooming supplies from our supplier network that fit that dogs) Tj T* (chewing intensity, style, and coat needs, and we ship them in a monthly subscription box. Over) Tj T* (time the profile gets better as the customer uploads more photos and gives feedback on how long) Tj T* (each item lasted, creating a feedback loop that improves recommendations for that dog and for) Tj T* (every other dog with a similar profile. We think of this as a data flywheel, where more) Tj T* (subscribers means better models, which means better products, which means lower churn.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Market) Tj T* () Tj T* (The pet industry in the United States is large and growing, and dog ownership in particular) Tj T* (represents a major share of that spending. Our target customer is the engaged dog owner,) Tj T* (typically a millennial or Gen Z household, who treats their dog as a family member and is) Tj T* (comfortable with subscriptions and apps. We estimate there are tens of millions of such) Tj T* (households nationally, and if even a small percentage subscribed to a service like ours at a) Tj T* (modest monthly price the market would be substantial. Our initial focus is on owners of medium) Tj T* (and large dogs who are heavy chewers, since they feel the problem most acutely and spend the) Tj T* (most replacing toys. We plan to start locally near our university and in a handful of similar) Tj T* (college towns, and then expand through online channels. We have not yet done a rigorous bottom) Tj T* (up market sizing and that is something we want to improve with mentorship.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Business Model) Tj T* () Tj T* (Our revenue comes from monthly subscription fees. We currently offer two tiers, a toy plan and) Tj T* (a toy plus grooming plan, priced competitively with existing pet subscription boxes but) Tj T* (positioned as more cost effective because products last longer. We source products from) Tj T* (wholesale suppliers and a small number of private label manufacturers and earn a margin on each) Tj T* (box after product cost, shipping, and packaging. Our early estimate of gross margin is in the) Tj ET
