BT /F1 10 Tf 12 TL 56 760 Td (range of thirty five to forty five percent though this will depend on volume and supplier) Tj T* (terms. Longer term we see additional revenue from selling anonymized insights to product makers) Tj T* (who want to know how their products perform in the real world, and from a premium tier with) Tj T* (advanced tracking. Customer acquisition is currently through word of mouth, campus groups, and) Tj T* (local dog parks, and we expect to add social media and referral incentives. Our customer) Tj T* (acquisition cost at scale is still unknown.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Competition) Tj T* () Tj T* (There are several existing pet subscription boxes that send curated toys and treats each month,) Tj T* (and there are also large online retailers and big box stores that sell the same products one at) Tj T* (a time. Most subscription boxes personalize only by dog size or by a short questionnaire, and) Tj T* (none that we are aware of use actual wear evidence from the dogs own toys. Our differentiation) Tj T* (is therefore the data and the personalization, along with the focus on durability. We recognize) Tj T* (that competitors have larger audiences, bigger budgets, and established supplier relationships,) Tj T* (and that a larger player could attempt to copy our approach if it proves valuable. Our defense) Tj T* (is the proprietary dataset we build and the quality of our recommendations, but we acknowledge) Tj T* (that this advantage is early and not yet proven at scale.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Team) Tj T* () Tj T* (Marisol Teague-Okonkwo is our chief executive and leads strategy, partnerships, and customer) Tj T* (relationships. She has owned dogs her whole life and was the original source of the idea after) Tj T* (a frustrating run of destroyed toys. Declan Hrubik is our chief technology officer and built) Tj T* (the prototype app and the image analysis pipeline. He has studied computer science and has) Tj T* (experience with machine learning coursework and side projects. Priyanka Vandersloot leads) Tj T* (operations and finance, including supplier sourcing, fulfillment, and budgeting. All three of) Tj T* (us are students at our university and are working on Bristlecone Pets alongside classes. We do) Tj T* (not yet have an advisor with deep experience in the pet industry or in subscription retail,) Tj T* (which we see as a gap.) Tj T* () Tj T* (Milestones and Financials) Tj T* () Tj T* (To date we have defined the core concept, built a working prototype, and formed the LLC. We) Tj T* (launched a website and brought on our first external users, who tested the app and gave us) Tj T* (feedback on the photo upload flow. Our first client has paid for a subscription box, which) Tj T* (validated that at least some people will pay for the service. We have a small number of) Tj T* (subscribers right now and we are still learning about retention. Our spending so far has been) Tj T* (modest and has come from personal savings of the founders, covering the LLC formation, the) Tj T* (website, early inventory, and cloud costs. We have not raised outside money. Our rough) Tj T* (projection is to reach a few hundred subscribers within the next twelve months, which would) Tj T* (produce recurring revenue that begins to cover our costs, although our detailed financial model) Tj T* (is still being refined and several assumptions, particularly churn and shipping costs, are) Tj T* (estimates.) Tj T* () Tj T* (What We Are Asking For) Tj T* () Tj T* (We are asking for funding to help us scale from our early users to a larger subscriber base,) Tj T* (primarily to purchase inventory in larger quantities, improve our image analysis models with) Tj T* (more training data, and run initial marketing tests. Beyond money, we are seeking mentorship) Tj T* (from people with experience in consumer subscription businesses and the pet industry,) Tj T* (introductions to suppliers and potential partners, and feedback on our market sizing, pricing,) Tj T* (and financial model. We believe the competition would help us turn a promising early stage idea) Tj T* (into a real and sustainable business, and we thank the judges for their time and consideration.) Tj ET
